<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1039012" n="281r"/>
  <opener><salute>Al <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-11887733X" type="person">Poleni</rs>.
      <lb/><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr> <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr> <choice><abbr>Prne</abbr><expan>Patrone</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Col.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Colendissimo</expan></choice></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Rendo grazie distinte à <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice> per la <rs type="letter">Lettera</rs> con cui Ella
      <lb/>si è compia<del><gap/></del><add>ciu</add>ta onorarmi, e nella quale Ella hà voluto inviar<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mi senza indugio quest’altera <rs type="letter">lettera</rs> à Lei capitata. L’<abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr>
      <lb/><abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs> la riverisce divotamente e dice non aver rice<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><add>vu</add>to dal <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1037587715" type="person">Ertz</rs> il <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_KGKQAP5S">Libro</rs> mentonato. Ardisco pregare
      <lb/><choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice> d’inviarmi <add>quanto prima sarà possibile</add> una Lira della Theriaca del <abbr>Sig.<hi rend="sup">r</hi></abbr>
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-136541146X">Alvise Martini</rs>, mi sarebbe grato, se potrebbe mettersi questa
      <lb/>Theriaca in <add>tal</add> vaso, che sia atto à essere trasmesso nella <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Patria</rs>
      <lb/><del><gap/></del>con alcuni <rs type="biblio">Libri</rs> sciolti che io colà mandarò la settimana
      <lb/>ventura, dimodo che questi <rs type="biblio">libri</rs> <add>non</add> ne ricevino nessun danno.
      <lb/>Io scrivo queste rozze <del><gap/></del>righe in Italiano per ubbidirla,
      <lb/>e però domando in premio della mia ubbidienza, che <choice><abbr>V.</abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S.</abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice> si degni correggerle <foreign xml:lang="lat"><hi rend="u">secundum leges Gra<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>aticorum et
      <lb/>bonorum morum</hi></foreign>. Secondo quello che intendo da <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice>
      <lb/>il viaggio dell’a<choice><orig><g ref="#nn">n̄</g></orig><reg>nn</reg></choice>o venturo sarà cambiato in una villeggia<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tura. Dii melius! Mà comunque la cosa sia, io le auguro
      <lb/>una ottima quiete in Città e mi professo con so<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>o ossequio</p>
  <closer><salute>Di <choice><abbr>V<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Vostra</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>S<supplied>.</supplied></abbr><expan>Signoria</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">ma</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissima</expan></choice>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Div.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Divotissimo</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Obblig.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr><expan>Obbligatissimo</expan></choice> <abbr>serv.</abbr> <choice><abbr>v.<hi rend="sup">ro</hi></abbr><expan>vero</expan></choice></salute>
      <lb/><signed><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">NB</rs></signed>.
      <lb/><dateline><rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venezia</rs> <date when="1718-08-13">13. Agosto 1718</date>.</dateline></closer>
<note hand="unknown">Polenus 1718 <abbr>Aug.</abbr></note>
</div>
